  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HAKUNA MATATA FOUNDATION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UTUKA NUPIPILA WANAMUANE &quot;Children and Youth playing and flourishing &quot; for cabo Delgado  - The Yopipila initiative led by a Consortium of local organisations including Hakuna Matata, has established itself as a green innovation hub in Pemba and Montepuez, testing, piloting, and promoting the co-creation of locally adaptation solutions, and providing life skills and promoting entrepreneurship and green technology practices involving young people, women and IDPs/Host families. With this new grant Hakuna Matata will build from previous grants (the &#x2018;3Rs Recycle - Reinvent &#x2013; Recover&#x2019; project Eco-Band: Som do Lixo) and transfer green technology to the education sector, in three conflict and shock affected districts, while further consolidating the institution capacity to deliver as an accredited training centre.</narrative>
  </description>
